#69: FILE: lib/vsprintf.c:1160:
 		switch (*fmt) {
[...]
+		case 'G':

switch should be at the same indent as case.
Example::

  switch (suffix) {
  case 'G':
  case 'g':
          mem <<= 30;
          break;
  case 'M':
  case 'm':
          mem <<= 20;
          break;
  case 'K':
  case 'k':
          mem <<= 10;
          fallthrough;
  default:
          break;
  }

See: https://www.kernel.org/doc/html/latest/process/coding-style.html#indentation

